3_77880243743566419_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SecPTF05QwEQ7kNvwHOlp2o&_nc_oc=Adr71Nze_JENOBp7cF69k4NxbjrlP4knztGmeUB5XXjtLWd_rniu-33BPNQj7gao76s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTnuY3tMRYmjXCAeflmjO5T3zyRVJ22kRal-2qdDzB2w&oe=6B0085D9"}, "display_name": "Fowl Play", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fowl Play is a winged flight simulator and playground where you use your hands to control wings with simulated yet realistic flight dynamics. Learn the basics of winged flight, carefully master the techniques, and experience the joys and thrills of free flight!\n\nPlay with up to 7 friends competitively or leisurely. Defeat other birds in combat with take-downs and explosive fireballs, and outmaneuver opponents through hazardous obstacles in Battle Mode. For a more relaxed experience, fly into a cozy fantasy sky world and soar together across castles, clouds, and floating islands in Peaceful Mode.\n\nWith solo play, take part in a game of exploration and navigation as you locate and unlock the exit in increasingly expansive labyrinths.\n\nOriginal music by Hurray for Excess! (https://linktr.ee/hurray_for_excess)\n", "short_description": "Become a bird and learn to fly! Use your new wings to propel yourself into a stylized aerial world. Master your flying techniques as you maneuver through 3D playgrounds. Soar together with your friends in peaceful skies or fight to become top raptor in fast-paced battle arenas. Challenge yourself to tests of agility in offline play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://magnopere.ca/fowl-play/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Magnopere", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://magnopere.ca/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "